{
    "comment": "템플릿 삭제 확인 창. 지우는 범위를 한 번 더 고른다 — 파일만 지울지, 그 템플릿이 쌓은 데이터\n  (편집한 레이아웃 등)까지 지울지. 모듈 삭제 창과 같은 형태다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "템플릿 제거 확인 모달",
        "editor_label": "$t:admin.modal_label.admin_template_list.template_uninstall_modal"
    },
    "id": "template_uninstall_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "{{_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length ? '$t:admin.templates.modals.uninstall_done_title' : '$t:admin.templates.modals.uninstall_title'}}",
        "size": "medium"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{!(_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length)}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "py-2"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "template_uninstall_icon",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "inline-flex flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Img",
                                    "if": "{{_global.selectedTemplate?.icon_url}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "src": "{{_global.selectedTemplate.icon_url}}",
                                        "alt": "",
                                        "loading": "lazy",
                                        "decoding": "async",
                                        "className": "w-5 h-5 object-contain"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "if": "{{!_global.selectedTemplate?.icon_url}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "{{_global.selectedTemplate?.type === 'admin' ? 'cog' : 'palette'}}",
                                        "className": "text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400",
                                        "aria-hidden": "true"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.uninstall_confirm|name={{_global.selectedTemplate.name}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2 text-label-subtle"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.uninstall_warning"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "delete_data_option",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{!(_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length)}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "mt-4 p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-start gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Checkbox",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "데이터까지 지우기 토글. 모듈 삭제 창과 달리 **함께 지워지는 것을 미리 물어보지 않는다** —\n                 템플릿이 쌓는 것은 편집한 레이아웃 정도라 목록으로 보여 줄 것이 없다.",
                                    "type": "change",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "deleteTemplateData": "{{$event.target.checked}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ],
                            "props": {
                                "checked": "{{_global.deleteTemplateData || false}}",
                                "className": "mt-0.5"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-body"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.delete_data_option"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "form-hint"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.delete_data_warning"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "extension_directory_section",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{!(_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length)}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "mt-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 pt-4"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-primary text-sm font-semibold"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.extension_directory_title"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!_global.templateUninstallInfo}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-center justify-center py-4"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "spinner",
                                "className": "text-xl animate-spin text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{_global.templateUninstallInfo && _global.templateUninstallInfo.extension_directory}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-center gap-2 mb-2"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "folder-open",
                                        "className": "text-base text-gray-500"
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-body font-medium"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.extension_directory_section"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-tertiary"
                                    },
                                    "text": "($t:admin.templates.modals.tables_total|size={{_global.templateUninstallInfo.extension_directory.size_formatted}})"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ml-6 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "flex-between px-3 py-1.5"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-xs font-mono text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_global.templateUninstallInfo.extension_directory.path}}"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-tertiary"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{_global.templateUninstallInfo.extension_directory.size_formatted}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "preserved_backups_section",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "mt-4 p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-lg"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-center gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "folder-open",
                                "className": "text-base text-gray-500"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-body font-medium"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.preserved_title"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2 text-label-subtle"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.templates.modals.preserved_desc"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-3 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg overflow-hidden"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "iteration": {
                                "source": "_global.templateUninstallBackups",
                                "item_var": "backup"
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 last:border-b-0"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Span",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-xs font-mono text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 select-all break-all"
                                    },
                                    "text": "{{backup.archive}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "modal-footer-buttons"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "if": "{{!(_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length)}}",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "closeModal"
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "className": "btn btn-secondary",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.isTemplateUninstalling}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "if": "{{!(_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length)}}",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "삭제 실행. 데이터 삭제 여부를 함께 보낸다 — 성공 갈래가 대상을 비우므로 요청 본문은 그 전에 조립된 값을 쓴다.",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "isTemplateUninstalling": true
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                    "target": "/api/admin/templates/uninstall",
                                    "auth_required": true,
                                    "params": {
                                        "method": "DELETE",
                                        "body": {
                                            "template_name": "{{_global.selectedTemplate.identifier}}",
                                            "delete_data": "{{_global.deleteTemplateData || false}}"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "onSuccess": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "isTemplateUninstalling": false
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "templateUninstallBackups": "{{response.data?.preserved_backups ?? []}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "success",
                                                "message": "$t:admin.templates.uninstall_success"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                            "params": {
                                                "dataSourceId": "templates"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "reloadExtensions"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "closeModal",
                                            "if": "{{!(response.data?.preserved_backups?.length)}}"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "if": "{{!(response.data?.preserved_backups?.length)}}",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "selectedTemplate": null,
                                                "deleteTemplateData": false
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "onError": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "isTemplateUninstalling": false
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "error",
                                                "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-red-600 dark:bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-red-700 dark:hover:bg-red-600 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.isTemplateUninstalling}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "if": "{{_global.isTemplateUninstalling}}",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "spinner",
                                "className": "spinner-sm"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "{{_global.isTemplateUninstalling ? '$t:admin.templates.uninstalling' : '$t:admin.templates.actions.uninstall'}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "if": "{{_global.templateUninstallBackups?.length}}",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "보존된 백업 안내를 본 뒤 닫는다 — 대상·데이터 삭제 선택·안내·백업 목록을 전부 비워야 다음에 다른 템플릿을 지울 때 이전 백업 경로가 남아 보이지 않는다.",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "closeModal"
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "창을 먼저 닫고 선택을 비운다 — 먼저 비우면 닫히는 몇 초 동안 문구의 확장 이름 자리가 빈 표시로 보였다(7.1.0 O-G3-7).",
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "selectedTemplate": null,
                                        "deleteTemplateData": false,
                                        "templateUninstallInfo": null,
                                        "templateUninstallBackups": null
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "className": "btn btn-secondary"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "$t:common.close"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
